==Latin==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|la|ǵerh₂}}
From {{inh|la|ine-pro|*ǵr̥h₂nóm}}. Cognates include Old Irish {{m|sga|grán}}, Breton {{m|br|greun}}, Old Church Slavonic {{m|cu|зрьно|tr=zrĭno|sc=Cyrs}}, Lithuanian {{m|lv|žirnis|žìrnis|pea}}, Persian {{m|fa|sc=fa-Arab|خرمن|tr=xarman||grain}} and Old English {{m|ang|corn||grain}} (English {{m|en|corn}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|grānum}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|grānum|grānī|n|second}}

# a [[grain]], [[seed]] or [[small]] [[kernel]]

